{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Invasive Plant</strong> is an\u00a0<strong>action-adventure shoot \u2019em up</strong> where you don\u2019t just play a hero\u2014you play the villain. Take control of two notorious invaders, <strong>English Ivy</strong> and <strong>English Holly</strong>, and unleash nature\u2019s fury against rival plants and human structures alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with explosive berries and unstoppable growth, you\u2019ll run, shoot, and spread your way across sprawling environments with one ultimate goal: <strong>total world domination</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two invasive species with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast rival plants and demolish buildings using berry firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, chaotic gameplay with nonstop action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim territory and spread your influence across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of conquering nature and civilization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you rise from the garden to global domination? The world is your ecosystem\u2014<strong>invade it!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052780/extras/041f8f77262b68d0a2e01c8ac0f0d997.avif?t=1759247091\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052780/extras/c1ce80c527dffa40f5cb9abf668c7f0d.avif?t=1759247091\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052780?t=1759247091","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052780?t=